WEBVTT

00:10.719 --> 00:11.804
Roaming the street's...

00:12.011 --> 00:13.094
end and lane's edge,

00:13.119 --> 00:14.296
yet never yielding.

00:14.636 --> 00:15.636
Peddling dope...

00:15.677 --> 00:16.565
and drugs,

00:16.590 --> 00:18.129
yet always
brotherhood shielding.

00:19.697 --> 00:21.142
After the turmoil...

00:23.315 --> 00:24.521
of killings,

00:24.986 --> 00:25.986
bloodbaths,

00:26.687 --> 00:27.971
loss,

00:28.466 --> 00:29.732
and pain,

00:30.942 --> 00:31.525
Ba...

00:31.550 --> 00:34.836
 In order to protect his friends, he gave his life
in the battle at The North Port.

00:36.093 --> 00:39.420
Hai Cuong went to prison
to pay for what he had done.

00:39.445 --> 00:41.385
Using his abilities,

00:41.410 --> 00:44.185
Hao has led Chinatown
to function more expertly each day.

00:44.210 --> 00:46.780
He has created
multiple flourishing front businesses.

00:46.844 --> 00:50.076
Long and Phong have
become his powerful right-hand men.

00:50.185 --> 00:52.486
The security situation
is more unstable than ever.

00:52.511 --> 00:57.826
Hung's leadership in the battle against
crime has intensified at this phase.

00:59.094 --> 01:00.037
That action...

01:00.062 --> 01:03.573
has had a direct impact
on the benefits of a covert group,

01:03.598 --> 01:05.647
forcing them to
free the tiger back into the woods.

01:05.940 --> 01:07.690
They are
considered to be the Council,

01:07.715 --> 01:10.089
a group that
manipulates the underworld's hierarchy.

01:11.990 --> 01:12.819
Chinatown...

01:12.844 --> 01:14.604
is more unstable than ever.

01:28.437 --> 01:32.047
BROTHERS FOR LIFE 3

01:38.880 --> 01:40.887
[Episode 5: Trade-off]

01:46.469 --> 01:48.317
Dung!

01:55.219 --> 01:56.061
Dung!

01:56.825 --> 01:57.770
Dung...

01:58.844 --> 01:59.944
Hang on!

01:59.969 --> 02:00.969
I'm here with you.

02:01.223 --> 02:02.198
It's going to be okay.

02:02.223 --> 02:03.320
I'm taking you to the hospital.

02:03.344 --> 02:03.963
Alright?

02:03.988 --> 02:05.194
It's okay.

02:05.219 --> 02:06.362
Everything's going to be okay.

02:06.386 --> 02:07.386
It's alright.

02:07.930 --> 02:08.930
It's alright.

02:11.320 --> 02:12.300
Bomb…

02:13.281 --> 02:14.281
Bomb…

02:15.034 --> 02:16.382
There's a bomb here.

02:41.840 --> 02:42.486
Long!

02:42.511 --> 02:43.307
Dung!

02:54.586 --> 02:55.586
Long!

03:17.590 --> 03:18.590
Phong!

03:19.739 --> 03:20.739
How is Long?

03:21.888 --> 03:22.888
Phong!

03:23.918 --> 03:24.918
Phong!

03:28.393 --> 03:29.154
Doctor,

03:29.179 --> 03:30.736
how is my friend's condition?

03:30.761 --> 03:32.138
His head is heavily injured.

03:32.163 --> 03:33.652
He needs more time...

03:33.677 --> 03:34.892
to fully recover.

03:35.261 --> 03:35.927
Thank you, doctor.

03:35.969 --> 03:36.969
Okay!

03:51.229 --> 03:53.229
You two are
the only friends I have left.

03:54.987 --> 03:56.799
Chinatown is
currently in a state of turmoil.

04:01.169 --> 04:03.093
I know I won't
be able to hold you back.

04:04.244 --> 04:05.524
But if you plan to do something,

04:07.886 --> 04:09.227
give me a heads-up.

04:12.239 --> 04:13.239
For what?

04:16.261 --> 04:17.386
Anything.

04:21.495 --> 04:22.929
What if it's illegal?

04:33.844 --> 04:35.044
Smoking is not permitted here.

04:36.636 --> 04:37.636
I'm just testing you.

04:38.965 --> 04:40.821
You're already trying to stop me.

04:44.719 --> 04:45.719
You handle...

04:45.927 --> 04:46.927
it your way,

04:51.898 --> 04:53.800
I'll do it my way.

05:02.927 --> 05:04.205
Don't forget to call me.

05:07.479 --> 05:08.479
Hello!

05:09.367 --> 05:10.563
Get the car.

05:42.924 --> 05:44.510
Let's go home, honey.

06:29.468 --> 06:30.468
Drink some water.

06:30.746 --> 06:31.918
I'll drink later.

06:35.761 --> 06:37.021
You should get some rest.

06:37.192 --> 06:38.520
Call me if you need anything.

06:48.261 --> 06:49.661
Let me
go prepare some food for you.

06:49.719 --> 06:50.361
Okay!

06:50.386 --> 06:51.886
I'll get in there in a minute.

07:26.909 --> 07:28.780
Long's life is tied to yours.

07:29.886 --> 07:31.046
Call me if you need anything.

07:31.106 --> 07:32.106
Yes, sir.

08:14.302 --> 08:15.477
Son of a bitch!

08:23.718 --> 08:25.027
Wise dogs know...

08:25.200 --> 08:26.957
whom to be loyal to.

08:27.909 --> 08:30.043
I see this throne as just average.

08:33.427 --> 08:35.101
Why bother fighting over it?

08:44.016 --> 08:46.797
[Sau Mui]

09:05.677 --> 09:06.677
Sau Mui.

09:06.754 --> 09:08.032
It has been six years since…

09:08.604 --> 09:10.953
Why has he returned all of a sudden?

09:12.427 --> 09:14.547
Something seems off here.

09:19.719 --> 09:20.719
Father.

09:24.721 --> 09:26.775
Have you got any
new updates about comrade Hung?

09:27.567 --> 09:28.671
No, I haven't.

10:44.177 --> 10:44.865
I'll tell you!

10:44.890 --> 10:45.890
Okay, I'll tell you!

10:47.036 --> 10:48.873
Go away.
There's nothing here to watch.

10:49.312 --> 10:50.812
Hey! Move!
Go away!

10:50.837 --> 10:52.165
We're fixing the stall.

12:11.297 --> 12:12.297
Hey!

12:12.322 --> 12:13.210
Where are you going?

12:14.100 --> 12:15.014
Tuan...

12:17.011 --> 12:18.011
What's up?

12:21.466 --> 12:22.329
What?

12:49.814 --> 12:50.814
Move up here.

12:51.265 --> 12:52.488
Hurry up, everybody.

12:52.513 --> 12:53.539
Hurry up.

13:00.120 --> 13:01.469
Do it quickly.

13:01.469 --> 13:02.469
My goodness!

13:19.378 --> 13:20.386
What are you recording?

13:32.261 --> 13:32.969
Those things over there.

13:32.969 --> 13:33.969
Hurry up! Hurry up!

13:36.976 --> 13:38.457
Okay. Quick. Quick.

13:39.177 --> 13:40.731
Good. Hurry up. Hurry up.

13:45.362 --> 13:46.948
Where is the other box?

14:23.098 --> 14:24.098
Hey!

14:24.937 --> 14:25.937
What's up?

14:46.903 --> 14:48.503
Put them
inside and close the door.

14:57.031 --> 14:58.156
Fuck!

14:58.511 --> 14:59.792
Nobody closed the damn door!

15:33.588 --> 15:34.698
Boss, we've come to the right place.

15:34.723 --> 15:35.723
Go.

15:57.213 --> 15:58.330
Come on!

16:25.788 --> 16:27.351
Go out there and get me that item!

17:09.469 --> 17:10.377
Check around!

17:10.427 --> 17:11.427
Yes, sir.

17:23.488 --> 17:24.488
Damn!

17:29.182 --> 17:30.182
What happened?

17:30.223 --> 17:31.223
Brother Sau.

17:31.447 --> 17:32.909
It looks like
there's an intruder.

17:36.386 --> 17:37.386
Go check around.

17:37.594 --> 17:38.594
Yes, sir.

18:03.966 --> 18:04.986
Quickly!

18:05.011 --> 18:06.011
Oh no.

18:06.229 --> 18:07.947
We are fucked.

18:11.969 --> 18:12.969
Boss.

18:13.027 --> 18:14.321
Our lives belong to you.

18:14.346 --> 18:15.983
We finally have
a chance to repay you.

18:20.056 --> 18:21.665
Worst case
scenario, we shall die.

18:22.117 --> 18:23.878
Be optimistic.

18:26.711 --> 18:27.711
March!

18:29.635 --> 18:31.067
Why haven't you both moved?

18:31.159 --> 18:32.542
Too many of them.

18:38.599 --> 18:39.919
Go!

19:21.004 --> 19:23.260
Boss. Dont leave me alone.

19:23.261 --> 19:24.261
Dont take care for me!

20:27.792 --> 20:28.917
Be careful!

20:46.750 --> 20:48.908
Boss.

20:49.456 --> 20:50.839
- Boss!
- Boss!

20:58.572 --> 20:59.540
Run, boss!

21:11.926 --> 21:12.926
Run Phong!

21:13.344 --> 21:15.386
Run!

21:21.680 --> 21:24.197
Brother Hung!

21:24.487 --> 21:25.576
No more protecting!

21:25.609 --> 21:26.444
Brother Hung!

21:26.469 --> 21:27.072
Run!

21:27.097 --> 21:28.097
Brother Hung!

21:29.463 --> 21:31.658
Brother Hung!

22:07.861 --> 22:08.527
Fuck.

22:08.552 --> 22:09.552
This bastard.

22:12.927 --> 22:14.040
Drive to Long's place!

22:15.219 --> 22:16.217
Hurry!

22:16.398 --> 22:17.398
Yes sir!

22:19.567 --> 22:20.400
Hello?

22:21.198 --> 22:22.926
Before midnight tonight.

22:23.432 --> 22:25.178
Your friend's phone,

22:25.817 --> 22:27.331
or his body.

22:28.113 --> 22:31.197
You call the cops,
you'll find out what's in store for you.

22:31.469 --> 22:32.742
Son of a bitch!

22:37.690 --> 22:39.269
Drive as fast as you can!

22:58.508 --> 23:01.977
 BROTHERS FOR LIFE 3
